<title>USA: Fonda Group acquires Astro unit of Tenneco.</title>
<headline>Fonda Group acquires Astro unit of Tenneco.</headline>
<dateline>VALHALLA, N.Y. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fonda Group Inc, a national producer paperboard- and tissue-based table top products and party goods, said Tuesday it had acquired substantially all the assets of the printed products division of Astro Valcour Inc, a unit of Tenneco Inc based in Glen Falls, New York.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Fonda said Astro produces, sells and distributes paper and plastic disposable products and accessories.</p>
